  "description": "CR 717.2a, 401.5, 601.3: Ranger Class makes a 2/2 green Wolf, at level 2 puts a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature whenever you attack, and at level 3 lets you look at your library's top card and cast a creature spell, not play a land, from there",
  "note": "At level 2 alice cannot cast the Hill Giant on top of her library and cannot see it. The non-attacking Wolf is no legal target; the counter goes on the attacking Bears, so the Bears and Llanowar Elves hit bob for 3 + 1, 21 to 17. At level 3 alice sees the Giant and casts it from the top; the Forest under it cannot be played from there, though alice has played no land this turn.",
